1
00:00:00,410 --> 00:00:02,660
(Penny:)Go away, Leonard.

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:04,880
Come on, let me
just talk to you.

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:07,080
(Penny:)It's open.

4
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,880
(Leonard:)Hey.

5
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:10,650
(Penny:)I'm not going
to that party, Leonard.

6
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:13,120
(Leonard:)Okay, listen.
You don't have to wear the wig.

7
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:15,120
(Leonard:)At this party,
we're gonna win first prize

8
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:17,220
(Leonard:)just by showing up with a girl.

9
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:20,320
(Penny:)It's not the wig.

10
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:22,090
(Leonard:)Did I do something?

11
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:23,790
(Leonard:)I mean, I tried to be
friends with Zack,

12
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,300
(Leonard:)like you said, which believe me,
was difficult,

13
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:28,670
(Leonard:)given how you and me
used to be...

14
00:00:28,670 --> 00:00:30,270
you know, "you and
me," and now you

15
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:32,770
(Leonard:)and him are
"you and him."

16
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:35,910
(Penny:)Okay, look.
We're not really "me and him."

17
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:37,540
(Leonard:)Then what are you?

18
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:39,510
(Leonard:)I don't know.

19
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:41,750
(Penny:)I only started seeing Zack again

20
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:43,780
(Penny:)so I wouldn't be alone
on New Year's Eve.

21
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:46,020
(Penny:)How pathetic is that?

22
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:48,550
(Leonard:)Not as pathetic
as dressing up like this

23
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:51,620
(Leonard:)and going to a comic book store
on New Year's Eve.

24
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:54,290
(Penny:)You make a cute Green Arrow.

25
00:00:59,930 --> 00:01:01,370
(Leonard:)Green Lantern.

